 "id": "trouble",
 "text": "The ledger cannot tell her. Favourites run out. The queue runs out of the door. A bookwyrm is found asleep in Herbalism, very full, and not at all sorry. And last week, a signed first edition bit a knight. It was a mimic. So Pip, the clerk, ran to the tavern to find adventurers, and a price was agreed in a doorway. Nobody wrote it down.",
